OL,3,GNEWSADad's death inspired my cancer
OL,4,Aresearch, says scientist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scientist behind pioneering research
OL,7,Finto a test which can show if a patient
OL,8,Fhas a brain tumour from their tears,
OL,9,Fsays the work was deeply personal to
OL,10,Fher.
OL,12,FProf Petra Hamerlik who is leading the
OL,13,Fstudy at the University of Manchester,
OL,14,Flost her father to a brain tumour at 15
OL,15,Fand said it took eight months to
OL,16,Fdiagnose the condition.
OL,18,FShe said the experience motivated her
OL,19,Fto find a better way to diagnose brain
OL,20,Ftumours and she has dedicated her life
OL,21,Fto cancer research.
