OL,3,GNEWSADad's death inspired my cancer
OL,4,Aresearch, says scientist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ground-breaking screening test,
OL,7,Fwhich started with a casual chat
OL,8,Fbetween two scientists in a bar in
OL,9,FDenmark in 2012, has proved successful
OL,10,Fin initial trials and the research is
OL,11,Fabout to be published worldwide.
